    "privacy.lastUpdated": "Last updated: August 2026",
    "privacy.intro": "MEALLIONS (\"the Company\") provides school lunch delivery service in Vancouver, BC, and takes your privacy seriously. This policy explains what information we collect, why we collect it, and how we use and store it.",
    "privacy.section1Title": "1. Information We Collect",
    "privacy.section1Item1Label": "Parent/guardian information",
    "privacy.section1Item1": "Name, phone number, delivery address, login ID, (optional) recovery email",
    "privacy.section1Item2Label": "Child information",
    "privacy.section1Item2": "Name, age, gender, allergies, and other health-related information needed for meal safety",
    "privacy.section1Item3Label": "Usage information",
    "privacy.section1Item3": "Order/skip history, payment history",
    "privacy.section2Title": "2. Why We Collect It",
    "privacy.section2Item1": "Lunch delivery and confirming the correct delivery address",
    "privacy.section2Item2": "Preparing meals safely around allergies",
    "privacy.section2Item3": "Processing and confirming payments (Interac e-Transfer)",
    "privacy.section2Item4": "Responding to inquiries and providing service updates",
    "privacy.section3Title": "3. Retention Period",
    "privacy.section3Body": "We keep your information while you use the service. If you request account deletion, we remove your data except records we're legally required to keep, such as payment records.",
    "privacy.section4Title": "4. Sharing with Third Parties",
    "privacy.section4Body": "We do not sell your personal information. We use backend infrastructure (Supabase) to the minimum extent needed to run the service, and otherwise do not share your data with third parties except where required by law.",
    "privacy.section5Title": "5. Protecting Children's Information",
    "privacy.section5Body": "Child information is entered by the parent/guardian and used only for meal safety (allergy handling) and delivery confirmation. Guardians can update or delete their child's information at any time from the profile screen.",
    "privacy.section6Title": "6. Your Rights",
    "privacy.section6Body": "You have the right to access, correct, or delete your own and your child's personal information. You can make changes directly in the \"My Info\" screen, or contact us using the details below.",
    "privacy.section7Title": "7. Security Measures",
    "privacy.section7Body": "Passwords are stored encrypted, and database access is strictly limited to your own data and administrators.",
    "privacy.section8Title": "8. Contact & Policy Changes",
    "privacy.section8Body": "If you have questions about this policy, please contact the admin through the service. If this policy changes, we'll let you know via in-app notices.",
